GPDK was tested with PVS 19.12 and MVS 19.2

GPDK fill directory contents:

ex_runPVSBatchFill_gds.csh

   Example top level run script for batch fill flow
   Procedure:
      1. Put PVS in the path, set license env var
      2. Create a run directory
      3. Set env var GPDK_INSTALL_DIR
      4. Run $GPDK_INSTALL_DIR/fill/ex_runPVSBatchFill_gds.csh \
                $GPDK_INSTALL_DIR/fill/Include/midcell_1.gds \
                midcell_1
      5. Examine output midcell_1_merged.gds

ex_runPVSBatchFill_oas.csh

   Example top level run script for batch fill flow
   Procedure:
      1. Put PVS in the path, set license env var
      2. Create a run directory
      3. Set env var GPDK_INSTALL_DIR
      4. Run $GPDK_INSTALL_DIR/fill/ex_runPVSBatchFill_oas.csh \
                $GPDK_INSTALL_DIR/fill/Include/midcell_1.oas \
                midcell_1
      5. Examine output midcell_1_merged.oas

runPVSBatchFill.csh

   Run script for PVS command line fill, used for gds and oas flows above
   runPVSBatchFill.csh <layout> <topcell> [<outputDir>] [<runset>]

merge_fillcell.tcl

   Utility used in runPVSBatchFill.csh for merging external fill cells,
   fillcell_n1.* and fillcell_p1.* below, into the final *merged* cell.

merge.tcl

   Utility used in runPVSBatchFill.csh for merging the standard fill output
   with the original design.

runPVSFill.il

   Virtuoso load script for running ipvsCreateFill from a pull-down menu.
   In .cdsinit use (GPDK_INSTALL_DIR must be set):
   load(strcat(getShellEnvVar("GPDK_INSTALL_DIR") "/fill/runPVSFill.il"))
   
StdFill_V05.pvl

   PVS Fill Deck

StdFill_V05.lmap

   PVS Fill Layer Map

StdFill_V05.omap

   PVS Fill Object Map

Include

   Directory with supporting files for fill

fillcell_n1.gds
fillcell_n1.oas
fillcell_p1.gds
fillcell_p1.oas

   Golden fill cell for use with the instance fill option in the runset

fill_rule.map

   Virtuoso fill flow support file for mapping rule names in PVS to layer
   names in Virtuoso.

midcell_1.gds

   Testcase layout
 
midcell_1.oas

   Testcase layout


